{"name": "The Whisker Watch", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Cats, Chaos &amp; Co-op!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video aria-label=\"combat\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994840/extras/9e5ea03a14352852f054647f45145d48.poster.avif?t=1791809668\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994840/extras/9e5ea03a14352852f054647f45145d48.webm?t=1791809668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994840/extras/9e5ea03a14352852f054647f45145d48.mp4?t=1791809668\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It\u2019s your night shift, Watchers! Your Human is asleep, the mansion is waking up, and only the cats can see what\u2019s crawling out of the Void. Team up in 2-player co-op to claw through the night, complete dangerous missions, and hold your secret night watch against the Chaos leaking from the Void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Cozy, but Weird Mansion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video aria-label=\"mansion upgrade\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994840/extras/e9f69b9e9ee9b4aa0bca09bd72129b77.poster.avif?t=1791809668\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994840/extras/e9f69b9e9ee9b4aa0bca09bd72129b77.webm?t=1791809668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994840/extras/e9f69b9e9ee9b4aa0bca09bd72129b77.mp4?t=1791809668\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cozy by day, cursed by night. Claim the mansion room by room: unlock new spaces, upgrade furniture, change wallpapers, floors, and decor, and turn a cursed old house into a home worth defending. Push back Void corruption by night, rebuild by day, and make the place stronger for the next run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Think Fast, Mischief Together, Grab Rewards</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video aria-label=\"boss combat\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994840/extras/664d1e469791487b54921af49cc62886.poster.avif?t=1791809668\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994840/extras/664d1e469791487b54921af49cc62886.webm?t=1791809668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994840/extras/664d1e469791487b54921af49cc62886.mp4?t=1791809668\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dash, slap, roll, barf, and tactically poop your way through fast, messy fights where standing still is a bad idea. Boost each other\u2019s abilities, combine combat gadgets, move heavy objects, rescue your partner, clear challenges, grab better rewards, and turn teamwork into wild fun worth repeating.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Upgrade, Unlock and Gear Up</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video aria-label=\"loot\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994840/extras/724556cbe03078e4616ed100def11c04.poster.avif?t=1791809668\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994840/extras/724556cbe03078e4616ed100def11c04.webm?t=1791809668\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994840/extras/724556cbe03078e4616ed100def11c04.mp4?t=1791809668\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Return home by day to spend your loot, upgrade rooms, weapons, combat gadgets, and perks, and make the mansion stronger for the next night. Unlock new furniture, floors, wallpapers, skins, accessories, and new ways to gear up your cats before diving back into the nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Paws up, Watchers! Team up as two house cats in a chaotic 2-player co-op action roguelite. Protect your Human after dark, upgrade your mansion by day, smash Void-born monsters, upgrade weapons and combat gadgets, grab the loot, and have fun making mischief.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994840/80c70962a9b32bf524b6b19ccc6344f98fdb0dd5/header.jpg?t=1791809668", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Online Co-Op", "Action Roguelike", "Roguelite", "Co-op", "Top-Down", "Multiplayer"], "developers": "Catch the Void", "publishers": "Catch the Void", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3994840", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "12 October 2026 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/1ocGbQP16KY", "first_seen": 1791756000.0, "review_rank": 30}